# HRS internal source material (SACs, scope & sequences, internal docs)
# Used to anchor brain-break content generation. Contents ignored to keep
# IP off GitHub. Keep README.md, .gitkeep, the subject folders, and each
# subject's .gitkeep so the high-level structure is visible to anyone
# cloning the repo. Year-level / unit subfolders are local-only.
source-material/*
!source-material/README.md
!source-material/.gitkeep
!source-material/english/
!source-material/maths/
!source-material/science/
!source-material/history/
!source-material/geography/
source-material/*/*
!source-material/*/.gitkeep
